# {{ shortName }}

Micro-frontend (MFE) application built with Module Federation.

## Scripts

- `pnpm dev` - Start development server on port {{ port }}
- `pnpm build` - Build for production
- `pnpm test` - Run tests
- `pnpm test:coverage` - Run tests with coverage

## Lifecycle Exports

This MFE exports the following lifecycle functions for Module Federation:

- `bootstrap()` - Initialize the MFE
- `mount(props)` - Mount the MFE into a container
- `unmount(props)` - Unmount the MFE from a container

## Development

Run `pnpm dev` to start the standalone development server. The MFE will be available at `http://localhost:{{ port }}`.

## Integration

This MFE can be loaded by any shell application configured to use it as a remote.
